        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents BRA-D04-K324, Fleur De Lis Interior Latch Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Fleur De Lis Interior Set has a beautiful backplate that features all the grandeur one might expect on the door of a royal palace. Every inch of the plate is dripping with elegance. The Ornate Fleur De Lis Door Latchset is available with your choice of knob or lever in a wide array of beautiful finishes including antique nickel, polished brass, and polished chrome. It is available in dummy, passage, or privacy functions for doors 1-3/8 inches thick or 1-3/4 inches thick with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Brass Accents D04-K324  Fleur De Lis Latchset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Cast Brass</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 12-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\" thick doors</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b>  No door latch. Door knob/lever on one side of the door. Package Includes: 1 knob/lever, 1 escutcheon plate, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b>  No door latch. Door knob/levers on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 knob/levers, 2 escutcheon plates, and mounting screws.</b>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 knob/levers, 2 escutcheon plates, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior escutcheon plate. Turning inside knob/lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 knob/levers, 2 escutcheon plates, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually.</i>\r\n</p>",
