                "description": "The Fleur De Lis Interior Set has a beautiful backplate that features all the grandeur one might expect on the door of a royal palace. Every inch of the plate is dripping with elegance. The Ornate Fleur De Lis Door Latchset is available with your choice of knob or lever in a wide array of beautiful finishes including antique nickel, polished brass, and polished chrome. It is available in dummy, passage, or privacy functions for doors 1-3/8 inches thick or 1-3/4 inches thick with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
